_L8 = [("Passage 1: a mom’s voice message to her son", "Juanito, si Nanay ito. Huwag mong kalimutan ang sinabi ko tungkol sa tulog. Sapat na tulog lang ang kailangan mo. Mga walong oras. Matulog ka nang maaga. Kailangan, alas-diyes pa lang natutulog ka na. Gigising ka nang maaga kinabukasan ano? Balita ko maaga kang nagigising. Kailangan mong matulog ng alas-diyes at gumising nang alas-sais. Walong oras na yon. Wag na wag kang uminom ng sleeping pills, ha? Masama iyan. Sapat na tulog lang ang kailangan mo. Tumawag ka o ako na ang tatawag bukas.", "Juanito, this is Nanay. Don’t forget what I told you about sleep. Enough sleep is all you need. About eight hours. Go to sleep early. By ten o’clock you should already be asleep. You will wake up early the next day, right? I heard you wake up early. You need to sleep at ten and wake up at six. That is eight hours. Never take sleeping pills, okay? That is bad. Enough sleep is all you need. Call me or I will call tomorrow."), ("Passage 2: an excerpt from a documentary", "Simpleng paglalakad, konting takbo, pag-i-iswimming, pag-ba-bike. Ilan lamang iyan ang nirerekomenda ng maraming espesyalista sa mga taong nakakaramdam na ng negatibo sa kanilang katawan. Maaaring ang ganitong mga aktibidades ay magagaan lamang. Pero malaki na ang naitutulong nito para lumakas ang resistensiya at may panangga na sa mga sakit. Mas lalong makakamit ang inaasahang kalusugan kung sasabayan pa ito ng tamang diet.", "Simple walking, a little running, swimming, biking. Those are only a few of what many specialists recommend to people who already feel something negative in their bodies. These activities may be light only. But they already help a lot in strengthening immunity and providing protection against diseases. The expected health will be even better achieved if this is accompanied by the proper diet."), ("Passage 3: an excerpt from a news report", "Nagsasagawa ang Department of Health ng mga kampanyang magbibigay pagpapahalaga sa kalusugan. Isa na nga rito ang Bawas Timbang thru Zumba Fitness. Pinaniniwalaan ding isang epektibong kasangkapan ang pagsasayaw sa paghihikayat sa mga Pilipino, lalo na sa mga kabataan. Hindi lang waistline ang mababantayan at napapangalagaan, kundi pati na rin ang mga malubhang sakit ay maaaring mawala o maiwasan.", "The Department of Health is conducting campaigns that will give importance to health. One of these is Bawas Timbang thru Zumba Fitness. Dancing is also believed to be an effective tool in encouraging Filipinos, especially the youth. Not only the waistline can be watched and cared for, but serious illnesses may also disappear or be avoided.")]
_K8 = [("Passage 1, item 1: the main idea", "Mom reminded her son about his sleeping habit."), ("Passage 1, item 2: the mom’s advice (3 details)", "(1) Sleep eight hours, from 10 PM to 6 AM; (2) don’t take sleeping pills; (3) it’s bad for the health; (4) you just need enough sleep."), ("Passage 2, item 3: three activities recommended by specialists", "Walking, running, swimming."), ("Passage 2, item 4: one more piece of advice", "Proper diet."), ("Passage 3, item 5: what the DOH launched", "A campaign for a healthy lifestyle through dancing (Bawas Timbang or Zumba Fitness); giving importance to health through dancing."), ("Passage 3, item 6: two positive effects of dancing", "Care for a (slimmer) waistline; cure or avoidance of acute illnesses.")]
_L9 = [("Reporter", "Kandahingal po ang mga babae at lalaking pulis sa pagsabak nila sa ten story ascension test. Kasama po sa hamon ng physical test ang mapanhik ng lalaking pulis ang sampung palapag ng gusali sa loob lang ng dalawang minuto at apatnapung segundo. Tatlong minuto at labinlimang segundo naman ang hamon sa kababaihan. Bago pumanhik sa gusali todo push up, sit up at takbo ang mga pulis sa Camp Bagong Diwa, Taguig. Naunang sumalang ang may isandaan at dalawampung pulis sa semestral physical fitness program. Pero absent ang mga matataba at umiwas bumagsak sa exam. At sa paunang resulta, apat na porsyento ng mga opisyal ang lumagpak. Ang ten story ascension test ang gagamiting basehan sa promosyon ng mga pulis.", "The policemen and policewomen were out of breath in taking the ten-story ascension test. Part of the challenge of the physical test is for a policeman to climb the ten floors of the building in only two minutes and forty seconds. For the women the challenge is three minutes and fifteen seconds. Before climbing the building, the police did all-out push-ups, sit-ups and running at Camp Bagong Diwa, Taguig. About one hundred twenty police went first in the semestral physical fitness program. But the fat ones, who avoided failing the exam, were absent. And in the preliminary result, four percent of the officers failed. The ten-story ascension test will be used as the basis for promotion of the police.")]
_K9 = [["Participants and number", "Police force (men and women); 120 participated"], ["Absent but were supposed to participate", "The fat ones who avoided failing the exam"], ["Location", "Camp Bagong Diwa, City of Taguig"], ["Physical test description", "Push-ups, sit-ups, running"], ["Extra challenge", "Policemen should be able to go up the 10-story building in 2 minutes and 40 seconds; the women in 3 minutes and 15 seconds"], ["Purpose", "Basis for promotion"], ["Results", "Four percent of the officers failed"]]
_L10 = [("Passage 1", "Para mapanatiling malakas at malusog ang ating mga katawan, uminom ng walong basong tubig araw-araw. Takpan ang ilong kapag nasa labas ng bahay para hindi makalanghap ng polusyon. Maglaan ng isang oras araw-araw para mag-ehersisyo. Sikaping matulog nang walong oras kada araw. At ang pinaka-importante, ugaliing kumain ng masusustansiyang pagkain. Alagaan ang kalusugan upang maka-iwas sa sakit at mapasigla ang pangangatawan.", "To keep our bodies strong and healthy, drink eight glasses of water every day. Cover your nose when you are outside the house so you do not inhale pollution. Set aside one hour every day for exercise. Try to sleep eight hours a day. And most important, make it a habit to eat nutritious foods. Take care of your health to avoid illness and to invigorate the body."), ("Passage 2", "Paano kung nasobrahan ka na sa pagkain? Isang kondisyon kung saan mayroong sobra kaysa sa kailangang taba ang katawan ng isang tao na maaaring magbunga ng masamang epekto sa kanyang kalusugan. Para maiwasan ito, kumain ng gulay, prutas at mahihiblang pagkain. Iwasan din ang sobrang pagkain. Uminom ng walo hanggang labindalawang baso ng tubig kada araw. Ugaliin ding mag-ehersisyo o maglaan ng oras para sa mga gawaing pisikal gaya ng simpleng paglalakad at paggamit ng hagdan kaysa elevator. Para naman sa may mga malalang kaso ng obesity, kumunsulta sa doktor para malaman kung kailangan nang uminom ng gamot. O kaya nama’y maisailalim sa operasyong tinatawag na bariatric surgery.", "What if you have overeaten? A condition where a person’s body has more fat than needed, which may result in bad effects on his health. To avoid this, eat vegetables, fruit and fibrous food. Also avoid overeating. Drink eight to twelve glasses of water a day. Make it a habit also to exercise or set aside time for physical activities such as simple walking and using the stairs rather than the elevator. As for those with severe cases of obesity, consult a doctor to know whether medicine is needed. Or else they may undergo an operation called bariatric surgery.")]
_VD = [["Passage 1 only", "Maintain a strong, healthy body. Cover your mouth when out of the house so you don’t inhale pollution. Sleep eight hours each day. Take care of your health to avoid diseases and give vitality to the body."], ["Both passages", "Drink 8 (or 8 to 12) glasses of water every day. Exercise or do physical activity (an hour a day in passage 1). Eat nutritious foods (fruits, vegetables and fiber-rich foods)."], ["Passage 2 only", "Avoid obesity and its bad effects. Avoid overeating. Do physical activities (walking, using the stairs, not the elevator). Those with severe obesity: consult a doctor to know if you need anti-obesity medicine or surgery."]]
